              ],
              "raw_id": "ev08",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "I was afraid of it at first, and started to run every time it turned around, for I thought it was going to chase me; but by and by I found it was only trying to get away"
        },
