              ],
              "raw_id": "ev12",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "the fire had revealed to me a new passion --quite new, and distinctly different from love, grief, and those others which I had already discovered--FEAR.  And it is horrible!"
